<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>Comment</key>
	<string>NinjaRemote (NCPlayer) has no public "latest" endpoint, Sparkle feed, or version manifest - the download URL hard-codes the build number in its S3 path. To update, get the current macOS player URL from the NinjaOne console (Administration -&gt; Library -&gt; Downloads), then bump the VERSION input (preferably in the override). The filename is version-stamped so the AutoPkg cache busts on change.</string>
	<key>Description</key>
	<string>Downloads a specific version of the NinjaRemote player (NCPlayer). Set VERSION to the build you want; see Comment for how to find the current build.</string>
	<key>Identifier</key>
	<string>com.davincid.download.NinjaRemoteplayer</string>
	<key>Input</key>
	<dict>
		<key>APP_FILENAME</key>
		<string>NCPlayer</string>
		<key>NAME</key>
		<string>NinjaRemote player</string>
		<key>VERSION</key>
		<string>13.35.8340</string>
		<key>DOWNLOAD_URL</key>
		<string>https://resources.ninjarmm.com/development/ninjacontrol/%VERSION%/ncplayer.dmg</string>
	</dict>
	<key>MinimumVersion</key>
	<string>2.3</string>
	<key>Process</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>Arguments</key>
			<dict>
				<key>filename</key>
				<string>%NAME%-%VERSION%.dmg</string>
				<key>url</key>
				<string>%DOWNLOAD_URL%</string>
			</dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>URLDownloader</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>EndOfCheckPhase</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Arguments</key>
			<dict>
				<key>input_path</key>
				<string>%pathname%/NCPlayer.app</string>
				<key>requirement</key>
				<string>identifier "com.ninjarmm.ncplayer" and anchor apple generic and certificate 1[field.1.2.840.113635.100.6.2.6] /* exists */ and certificate leaf[field.1.2.840.113635.100.6.1.13] /* exists */ and certificate leaf[subject.OU] = EBNT3ZX97E</string>
			</dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>CodeSignatureVerifier</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>Arguments</key>
			<dict>
				<key>input_plist_path</key>
				<string>%pathname%/NCPlayer.app/Contents/Info.plist</string>
				<key>plist_version_key</key>
				<string>CFBundleShortVersionString</string>
			</dict>
			<key>Processor</key>
			<string>Versioner</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
